"""cyberghost-wg - WireGuard configurations for CyberGhost VPN, without the official client.

Unofficial and not affiliated with CyberGhost. It makes the same calls as the
official Linux client 1.5.0, to an undocumented API that may change at any time:

  login    POST   /my/account/jwt          account JWT
           POST   /my/devices              device token + secret (created once)
  countries GET   /my/servers/filters/75   torrent countries, or /73 for all servers
  servers  GET    /my/servers/filters/71   torrent servers, /74 all servers, /95 NoSpy servers
  services GET    /my/servers/filters/76   streaming services, then /72 for the servers of one
  gaming   GET    /my/servers/filters/86   server groups: the gaming group's hostname per country
  conf     GET    https://<instance>.cg-dialup.net:1337/addKey?pubkey=...
                                           (HTTP Basic auth with the device token + secret)
  logout   DELETE /my/devices/<id>

A key registered with addKey must be used within a few minutes (refused after 5 in tests).
Requirements: Python 3.8+, standard library only.
"""

